    IF net AT MOST `the limit on the net figure` OR gross AT MOST `the limit on the gross figure`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Not more than £15 million net (or £18 million gross)"

