-- src:4882 | (5) The aggregate figures are ascertained by aggregating the relevant figures determined in accordance with section 382 for each member of the group.
@ref s 383(5) The aggregate figures (src:4882)
GIVEN `the figures determined in accordance with section 382 for each member of the group` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 383(5) the aggregate figure` MEANS
    sum `the figures determined in accordance with section 382 for each member of the group`

DECLARE `s 383(6) the accounts the figures are taken from` IS ONE OF
    `s 383(6)(a) Companies Act accounts`
    `s 383(6)(b) IAS accounts`

-- src:4883 | (6) In relation to the aggregate figures for turnover and balance sheet total—
-- src:4884 | “net” means after any set-offs and other adjustments made to eliminate group transactions—
-- src:4885 | (a) in the case of Companies Act accounts, in accordance with regulations under section 404,
-- src:4886 | (b) in the case of IAS accounts, in accordance with UK-adopted international accounting standards; and
-- src:4887 | “gross” means without those set-offs and other adjustments.
@ref s 383(6) "net" and "gross" (src:4883-4887)
GIVEN accounts IS A `s 383(6) the accounts the figures are taken from`
      `the aggregate before any set-offs or other adjustments` IS A NUMBER
      `the set-offs and other adjustments made to eliminate group transactions in accordance with regulations under section 404` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the set-offs and other adjustments made to eliminate group transactions in accordance with UK-adopted international accounting standards` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 383(6) the net figure` MEANS
    CONSIDER accounts
    WHEN `s 383(6)(a) Companies Act accounts` THEN
        CONSIDER `the set-offs and other adjustments made to eliminate group transactions in accordance with regulations under section 404`
        WHEN JUST adjustments THEN JUST (`the aggregate before any set-offs or other adjustments` MINUS adjustments)
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the regulations under section 404 are not among the sources
    WHEN `s 383(6)(b) IAS accounts` THEN
        CONSIDER `the set-offs and other adjustments made to eliminate group transactions in accordance with UK-adopted international accounting standards`
        WHEN JUST adjustments THEN JUST (`the aggregate before any set-offs or other adjustments` MINUS adjustments)
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): UK-adopted international accounting standards are not among the sources

-- src:4887 | “gross” means without those set-offs and other adjustments.
@ref s 383(6) "gross" (src:4887)
GIVEN `the aggregate before any set-offs or other adjustments` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 383(6) the gross figure` MEANS
    `the aggregate before any set-offs or other adjustments`

DECLARE `s 383(7) which financial year's figures are taken` IS ONE OF
    `s 383(7)(a) the subsidiary undertaking's financial year that ends with that of the parent company`
    `s 383(7)(b) the subsidiary undertaking's financial year ending last before the end of the financial year of the parent company`
    `s 383(7) the latest available figures`

-- src:4889 | (7) The figures for each subsidiary undertaking shall be those included in its individual accounts for the relevant financial year, that is—
-- src:4890 | (a) if its financial year ends with that of the parent company, that financial year, and
-- src:4891 | (b) if not, its financial year ending last before the end of the financial year of the parent company.
-- src:4892 | If those figures cannot be obtained without disproportionate expense or undue delay, the latest available figures shall be taken.
@ref s 383(7) The figures for each subsidiary undertaking (src:4889-4892)
GIVEN `its financial year ends with that of the parent company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the figures can be obtained without disproportionate expense or undue delay` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 383(7) which financial year's figures are taken`
`s 383(7) which financial year's figures are taken for the subsidiary undertaking` MEANS
    IF NOT `the figures can be obtained without disproportionate expense or undue delay`
    THEN `s 383(7) the latest available figures`
    ELSE IF `its financial year ends with that of the parent company`
         THEN `s 383(7)(a) the subsidiary undertaking's financial year that ends with that of the parent company`
         ELSE `s 383(7)(b) the subsidiary undertaking's financial year ending last before the end of the financial year of the parent company`

